{"v":4,"catch":"STEP THEATERへようこそ！","desc":"舞台はとある映画館。音楽に合わせた操作で、上映されるさまざまな物語を進めます。プレイを進めると新たなステージが登場し、舞台や楽曲、キャラクターのアクションも変化。シンプルな操作と、キュートなアニメーション、ポップな楽曲が組み合わさり、遊んでも見ていても楽しめます。","publisher":"エヌビーゲームズ","release":"2026-12-03","genres":["音樂","動作"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日本語","英語","中国語 (簡体字)","中国語 (繁体字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"3+","size":"Switch 2 2.5GB / Switch 2.5GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c47817a12ba7f4284a5e7110715119b8a1819bfb7823bb891f8a56df06231fbb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b5dc602d683575a9f80257d75ccbc63975065cd6faf61a793da25a49b8f1d811.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f0ad1eaaaea9596a1add3d769acffd48803735e746364ecc699bf4aff37f10d2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/86c1001d2cd6726e637f87f3dda6b0d14754d6f4672148d8817d83dcb43bc59d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/25cb0166323a9e0e34f1f0271faae0cd89c2fee37057003ce4290809869ccd14.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f84f813d0b4bded1f30e973927b958d281a17d649390fcc83390e6529be98662.jpg"],"titleId":"010022b0285c0000"}